WEBVTT

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:05.701
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:09.973
Todoke Message

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:19.308
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:20.587
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:28.628
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:28.957
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:36.364
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:40.866
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:44.967
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:49.374
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:52.950
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:57.279
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:01.424
Todoke Message

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:09.928
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:14.306
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:18.507
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:28.410
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:34.719
Several days had passed since the
liberation of Kinka's mayor, Shin Sai...

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:39.256
...and the banishment of the
Murderous Blades from the city.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.168
A government official said
to have arrived from Koren...

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:45.704
...appeared in front of
Shurei and the others...

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:48.400
...as they were busily processing
matters relating to the incident.

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.033
You're Mr. Jun Yu from Koren?

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:52.372
Yes.

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:57.311
So you've come after all!
Is everything going to be okay there?

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.585
Right now, what's important...

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:03.110
...is that we immediately normalize
the situation in the town of Kinka.

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:06.587
A-Ah, right. You're absolutely right!

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:11.063
Hey, would you properly introduce him to
us, rather than just telling us his name?

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:15.400
Let's save that stuff for later.
We've got a mountain-load of work!

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:18.204
That stuff...?

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:25.567
It's Always Darkest Before the Dawn

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:33.049
Um, Official Yu. Regarding this...!

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:38.955
Ah, since it's necessary that
this be checked and verified...

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:42.859
...against the taxation documents from
last year, I'll take care of it.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:47.122
But more importantly, I'd
like to have you approve this.

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:49.462
Right.

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:52.004
Please stamp this document
with your seal as well.

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:53.003
Right.

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:57.099
After that, there's this, that
one, this... and this one, too.

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:02.405
You got quite a lot again.

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:05.283
Yes. But if by doing our job like this...

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:09.082
...we bring happiness to
the people of Kinka...!

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:15.461
You're right. But just think what could've
happened if those two weren't here.

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:20.395
Even though we've been appointed as
governors, we're still complete novices.

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:23.864
The fact is, we don't know left from right.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:29.107
Our job is just to put our signatures and
seal on the documents they've verified.

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:33.846
Not to mention Official Yu's
precise and quick assistance.

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:38.776
Come on. Don't just sit there, I
need a stamp on this too, please.

00:03:41.888 --> 00:03:44.152
Man, why is there so much work?!

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:50.285
Official Yu! I'm so sorry, I'm sorry!

00:03:50.597 --> 00:03:54.556
No, no, it's all right. None
of it got on the documents.

00:03:56.169 --> 00:03:59.138
I'm so embarrassed with myself.

00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:01.506
Me too.

00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:03.542
It's to be expected at this stage.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:07.808
Yeah, that's right. Besides, you two are
doing much better than I did in my time!

00:04:08.481 --> 00:04:10.779
That's nothing to brag about.

00:04:11.217 --> 00:04:14.186
Or are you making excuses for
the way you irresponsibly...

00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:17.223
...put your seal on documents
without even reading through them...

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:19.850
...or behaving recklessly
whenever you had a moment?

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:22.217
That was unavoidable.

00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:24.661
Back then, assassins from
the Sa Clan were so persistent.

00:04:25.198 --> 00:04:28.292
Besides, that was ten years ago.
You've got a great memory.

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:31.396
Yes. I remember it very well.

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:34.403
Even in a hundred years, I won't
forget the kindness you paid me...

00:04:34.474 --> 00:04:36.533
...by pushing me into a
manure pool without warning.

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:39.840
But that was to save you
from a poisonous arrow!

00:04:39.912 --> 00:04:42.005
And besides, thanks to that incident...

00:04:42.215 --> 00:04:44.740
...people who used to think you
were difficult to approach...

00:04:44.817 --> 00:04:47.718
...started coming to you.

00:04:48.688 --> 00:04:51.088
Please refrain from
making pointless excuses.

00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:52.652
More importantly...

00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:54.317
...the taxation information
for last year is on the bookshelf...

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:58.487
...on the north side, it's the second
from the right, fifth shelf from the top.

00:04:59.165 --> 00:05:01.133
Yes, sir!

00:05:01.534 --> 00:05:04.196
Those two really get along!

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:07.606
Yes, they do! The thing is,
Ensei's doing everything.

00:05:08.107 --> 00:05:11.304
I haven't seen Official Yu
get up from his seat once.

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:13.276
I-Is that so?

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.247
Ensei's the type of guy...

00:05:15.315 --> 00:05:18.079
...you'd assume has muscles
in his head instead of brains.

00:05:18.718 --> 00:05:21.084
He's got to continually be
moving, or he gets restless.

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:26.490
That's right. Exactly. Wait, why
would you go say a thing like that?

00:05:40.707 --> 00:05:44.040
I understand that you buried
Sojun Sa all by yourself.

00:05:45.278 --> 00:05:49.339
Yes. As a member of the Sa Clan,
it was the least I could do.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.940
That's impressive.

00:05:52.018 --> 00:05:54.384
No, you're the
ones who are incredible.

00:05:55.221 --> 00:05:57.348
You've chased the Murderous
Blades out of Kinka...

00:05:57.423 --> 00:05:59.721
...and liberated it from
the hands of the Sa Clan.

00:05:59.792 --> 00:06:02.420
That wasn't something
that we did on our own.

00:06:03.196 --> 00:06:06.757
Even so, you're incredible!
Especially Miss Shurei.

00:06:13.706 --> 00:06:15.674
I should get back to work.

00:06:20.546 --> 00:06:22.514
In comparison, I...!

00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:40.589
Listen, Shunki.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:44.898
Read the stars, and gauge
the time. And when that time comes...!

00:06:45.905 --> 00:06:47.873
Miss Shunki!

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.978
So you've come all the way down here.

00:06:53.312 --> 00:06:56.406
Your legs have become a
lot stronger, Miss Shunki!

00:06:58.518 --> 00:07:00.486
You've cut your hand on a thorn.

00:07:00.553 --> 00:07:02.817
When we get home, let me
mix some medicine for you.

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:06.759
When we arrived here, your hands
were like those of a princess.

00:07:09.929 --> 00:07:13.626
If only I could bring back your voice
with medicinal herbs, Miss Shunki.

00:07:21.574 --> 00:07:25.476
Boss! Miss Shunki! I just
finished preparing lunch!

00:07:28.247 --> 00:07:32.411
You were able to pick quite a lot! Huh!
Those are poisonous mushrooms.

00:07:33.553 --> 00:07:34.781
You idiot, Yoshun!

00:07:34.921 --> 00:07:37.253
Are you trying to embarrass the girl?!

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.281
When things like that happen,
you tell her later, in secret.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:44.689
I wasn't thinking!
I'm sorry, Miss Shunki!

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.292
Listen, Yoshun!

00:07:49.368 --> 00:07:51.836
We must do everything to ensure
the safety of Miss Shunki...

00:07:51.971 --> 00:07:53.962
...who was entrusted to
us by Ensei Ro.

00:07:54.674 --> 00:07:56.801
There's no way we can
accomplish this important task...

00:07:56.876 --> 00:07:57.808
...with half hearted devotion.

00:07:58.311 --> 00:07:59.209
Yes!

00:07:59.579 --> 00:08:01.911
However, by fulfilling
this important task...

00:08:02.014 --> 00:08:04.209
...we will mature into a
second generation of...

00:08:04.283 --> 00:08:06.547
...Bald Eagles of Sa Province
chivalrous thieves!

00:08:07.019 --> 00:08:08.646
Yes, boss!

00:08:12.458 --> 00:08:16.827
When that time comes,
you shall do what you need to do.

00:08:23.503 --> 00:08:26.563
Delicious! Korin,
your skills have improved.

00:08:27.073 --> 00:08:30.509
Nonsense. I still hardly
compare to you, Miss Shurei.

00:08:31.043 --> 00:08:32.670
Hey, hey!

00:08:32.745 --> 00:08:34.804
Can I have two bean
paste buns too?

00:08:35.882 --> 00:08:37.406
Why does just Princess
get more than one?

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:40.045
It's a difference in affection.

00:08:40.453 --> 00:08:42.921
I have never in my life
been shown so clearly...

00:08:42.989 --> 00:08:45.423
...the difference in the amount
of affection one has for me.

00:08:45.892 --> 00:08:50.386
Don't sulk. Official Yu and
Eigetsu only got one each, too.

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:53.958
But mine's the smallest!

00:08:54.667 --> 00:08:58.501
They're all the same size!
Fine, I'll give you half of one.

00:08:59.138 --> 00:09:00.469
All right!

00:09:10.316 --> 00:09:12.284
A chestnut?

00:09:15.655 --> 00:09:17.919
I see. A difference in affection.

00:09:24.096 --> 00:09:26.064
I'll go and make more
tea for everyone!

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:32.335
By the way, Ensei, would you mind
telling us what's going on in Koren?

00:09:33.973 --> 00:09:37.306
I mean, you made such an effort
to get us to Sa Province quickly...

00:09:38.044 --> 00:09:40.512
...but you haven't said a
thing since we arrived here.

00:09:40.746 --> 00:09:44.182
It's true we'll arrive in Koren in
five days, even at a relaxed pace...

00:09:44.817 --> 00:09:47.081
...but we only have twenty days
before our deadline to get there...

00:09:47.153 --> 00:09:48.017
...and take our post.

00:09:48.187 --> 00:09:50.553
If we're late, our post as
governors will be stripped from us...

00:09:50.623 --> 00:09:52.420
...regardless of the circumstances.

00:09:52.758 --> 00:09:55.955
I realize that. But bear
with me a bit longer.

00:09:56.762 --> 00:10:00.664
We should be getting the latest
news on Koren by way of Sho Sai.

00:10:02.301 --> 00:10:07.102
I see. But Ensei, will Lieutenant
Governor Tei be all right?

00:10:08.174 --> 00:10:13.612
Yushun? Yeah, he'll be fine.

00:10:13.779 --> 00:10:16.077
That's your answer? Aren't
you worried about him?

00:10:16.182 --> 00:10:19.345
Exactly! Until now,
as acting governor...

00:10:19.518 --> 00:10:22.976
...he held the highest decision-making
authority, so he was safe.

00:10:23.089 --> 00:10:26.320
But the moment we take our posts
and his authority is transferred to us...

00:10:26.892 --> 00:10:28.723
...his life could be in danger!

00:10:30.863 --> 00:10:34.094
If Yushun heard that line, he'd
be so happy he'd burst into tears.

00:10:34.767 --> 00:10:36.735
Yes, he sure would.

00:10:36.936 --> 00:10:38.904
In his case, there's no need to worry.

00:10:39.271 --> 00:10:40.795
You're absolutely positive?

00:10:41.073 --> 00:10:42.040
Absolutely.

00:10:42.108 --> 00:10:45.874
Not even Sakujun Sa himself
could do anything about Yushun.

00:10:50.082 --> 00:10:53.381
The two of us decided to transfer
all authority as governors to you...

00:10:53.819 --> 00:10:57.721
...in the best possible state.
So please put your trust in Yushun.

00:10:58.724 --> 00:11:01.716
You know, the two of us are
truly blessed, aren't we?

00:11:02.328 --> 00:11:05.297
Yes. It was the proper
decision for His Majesty...

00:11:05.364 --> 00:11:08.356
...to send you to Sa Province for
your first place of assignment.

00:11:10.436 --> 00:11:12.700
Given your predecessor is Ensei Ro...

00:11:13.372 --> 00:11:18.173
...the circumstances with your age
and gender will not even be an issue.

00:11:18.811 --> 00:11:22.542
You have nerve to say that in
front of me, but it's true.

00:11:22.848 --> 00:11:27.376
It really was a province abandoned
by the central government.

00:11:28.521 --> 00:11:30.682
Deep down, everyone was anxious.

00:11:31.257 --> 00:11:34.749
But then people received word that
legitimate governors would be arriving...

00:11:35.628 --> 00:11:38.188
...governors whom His Majesty
had bestowed flowers upon.

00:11:38.731 --> 00:11:41.199
The people of Sa Province
rejoiced upon hearing the news.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:44.025
Why were people so happy?

00:11:44.704 --> 00:11:47.605
The flower is proof of His
Majesty's absolute trust.

00:11:48.774 --> 00:11:52.232
Those with flowers bestowed upon them
are rarely assigned to work in districts.

00:11:52.845 --> 00:11:55.143
Dispatching such governors
tells the people...

00:11:55.214 --> 00:11:58.741
...that the king is clearly
committed to this province.

00:11:59.919 --> 00:12:02.717
Not only does bestowing the
flower protect you personally...

00:12:02.988 --> 00:12:06.947
...it also spares Sa Province from its
laments and fears. It's a brilliant move.

00:12:07.393 --> 00:12:10.920
There's one more reason why it was
good for you to come to Sa Province.

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:12.929
What?

00:12:12.998 --> 00:12:15.398
The headquarters of the
Merchants Guild in Sa Province...

00:12:15.468 --> 00:12:17.459
...is run by Sho Sai's older sister.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:21.606
Her ability to run things puts men to
shame... repeatedly, as a matter of fact.

00:12:22.208 --> 00:12:24.938
For that reason, there will likely be...

00:12:25.377 --> 00:12:27.845
...less prejudice towards a female
governor than in other provinces.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:30.275
I believe this is the best
place for the first female...

00:12:30.349 --> 00:12:32.317
...government official's assignment.

00:12:32.551 --> 00:12:35.850
Really, how much did Ryuki
think this through?

00:12:36.889 --> 00:12:38.254
Excuse me.

00:12:38.724 --> 00:12:41.090
Sho Sai has asked to see you.

00:12:41.527 --> 00:12:43.620
Oh, so he's here. Let him in.

00:12:45.197 --> 00:12:47.324
So, how were things?

00:12:48.768 --> 00:12:51.066
By the order of Lieutenant Governor
Tei an announcement has been...

00:12:51.137 --> 00:12:53.662
...issued for a complete
blockade of Koren...

00:12:53.739 --> 00:12:56.606
...the provincial capital,
as of four days ago.

00:12:57.076 --> 00:12:58.737
A complete blockade?!

00:12:58.811 --> 00:13:01.109
That certainly is a forceful move.

00:13:01.814 --> 00:13:03.645
The reason given is that...

00:13:03.716 --> 00:13:05.581
...since the two new governors
have already arrived in Koren...

00:13:05.651 --> 00:13:08.916
...they are to be protected
from any possible danger...

00:13:09.188 --> 00:13:11.349
...until the assignment ceremony.

00:13:11.891 --> 00:13:13.722
That's ridiculous.

00:13:13.793 --> 00:13:16.261
In addition, rumors have
been spreading...

00:13:16.328 --> 00:13:18.990
...alleging that the new governors are
under Sa Clan protection.

00:13:19.331 --> 00:13:21.663
People interpret this as the governors
already being under Sa control.

00:13:21.734 --> 00:13:24.498
Popularity of the new governors
is quickly declining.

00:13:25.304 --> 00:13:29.263
Great. Now the Sa Clan is
spreading preposterous rumors.

00:13:30.376 --> 00:13:32.344
What should we do?

00:13:34.046 --> 00:13:36.310
Okay then, we'll leave
tomorrow morning.

00:13:38.117 --> 00:13:40.415
So get to bed early tonight.

00:13:42.021 --> 00:13:46.981
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:13:50.229 --> 00:13:52.197
Yes?

00:13:53.833 --> 00:13:57.701
What is it? I'm busy packing,
so make it quick.

00:13:58.404 --> 00:14:00.372
We're leaving early tomorrow, right.

00:14:01.774 --> 00:14:04.868
Say, have you talked
to Seiran lately?

00:14:06.879 --> 00:14:09.746
No. We've both been busy with work.

00:14:10.683 --> 00:14:13.880
Would you have a heart
to heart talk with him?

00:14:19.124 --> 00:14:23.117
Ensei doesn't seem like a details sort
of guy, but he's really perceptive!

00:14:25.397 --> 00:14:27.592
My lady, so this is where you were.

00:14:29.468 --> 00:14:30.901
Yes.

00:14:35.107 --> 00:14:37.302
Seiran. Let's have some tea.

00:14:42.114 --> 00:14:44.378
But there's not much time left to sleep.

00:14:45.117 --> 00:14:47.585
If I slept now, I'm not sure
I could wake up in time.

00:14:51.156 --> 00:14:54.091
Why are you starting to make bean
paste buns at this time of night?

00:14:55.094 --> 00:14:56.584
Um... well...!

00:14:57.196 --> 00:14:59.164
Is something bothering you?

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.526
You see, you're my second favorite
person in the world, Seiran.

00:15:06.105 --> 00:15:07.265
Are you all right?

00:15:07.606 --> 00:15:09.767
W-What's gotten into you, suddenly?

00:15:11.143 --> 00:15:13.202
I'm just as surprised myself
that I said that.

00:15:13.279 --> 00:15:15.941
It came out pretty naturally, didn't it?

00:15:16.548 --> 00:15:17.879
It was as natural as saying...

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:21.442
..."peach buns are my second
favorite in the world".

00:15:25.224 --> 00:15:27.124
The second-most favorite in the world?

00:15:27.192 --> 00:15:30.753
Am I supposed to be happy about
it or cry about it? My lady.

00:15:31.463 --> 00:15:34.296
Rather than give me a strange
laugh, give me an explanation.

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:40.563
What should I do?

00:15:41.206 --> 00:15:41.695
About what?

00:15:42.875 --> 00:15:46.504
Ever since I was little,
I've always seen...

00:15:47.112 --> 00:15:50.377
...just how much the clan has
tormented the people of Sa Province.

00:15:50.883 --> 00:15:53.681
And now, even brother
Sakujun is doing it.

00:15:54.987 --> 00:15:56.454
So?

00:15:59.391 --> 00:16:02.952
I'm sure you already know what
to do without having to ask me.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:08.860
Believe in yourself.
Do as you believe you should.

00:16:10.202 --> 00:16:12.170
Mr. Ensei...

00:16:15.441 --> 00:16:17.409
Thank you very much.

00:16:21.046 --> 00:16:23.913
Now, I wonder what's
happening over there.

00:16:28.721 --> 00:16:31.952
It's been a while since we've sat
down and talked like this, hasn't it?

00:16:33.158 --> 00:16:35.126
Uh, w-well, I-I suppose so.

00:16:35.894 --> 00:16:38.362
Is there something
you'd like to ask me?

00:16:39.398 --> 00:16:40.888
L-Like what?

00:16:40.966 --> 00:16:43.127
I seem to have caused
you a lot of worry...

00:16:43.202 --> 00:16:45.670
...because of that incident with
that stupid young master.

00:16:46.405 --> 00:16:48.873
You can ask me whatever you want so
we can clear the air before we set out.

00:16:50.476 --> 00:16:55.038
It's supposed to be my job
to support you. Pathetic.

00:16:56.882 --> 00:16:57.849
My Lady.

00:16:57.916 --> 00:16:59.383
There's the old Seiran.

00:17:00.953 --> 00:17:03.854
Is it all right if I ask you who
your number one favorite person is?

00:17:04.423 --> 00:17:06.391
Oh, it's father.

00:17:06.525 --> 00:17:09.085
Even though he's a hopeless father,
he's always been my number one.

00:17:10.129 --> 00:17:12.120
But mother's in a different category.

00:17:12.431 --> 00:17:15.332
My Lady. Do you like Sakujun Sa?

00:17:16.735 --> 00:17:20.068
Th-That was surprisingly
direct for Seiran.

00:17:21.006 --> 00:17:23.873
I really have no choice
but to answer I don't know.

00:17:24.643 --> 00:17:25.132
Oh?

00:17:25.978 --> 00:17:27.104
Seiran, I'm sure you know.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:31.005
I'm totally unfamiliar
with this kind of thing.

00:17:31.583 --> 00:17:35.485
Remember, mother got along
really well with father.

00:17:36.121 --> 00:17:37.315
Yes.

00:17:37.389 --> 00:17:42.258
As a child, I remember how
cheerful and fun it always was.

00:17:42.995 --> 00:17:45.964
That was because madam would
insist on making medicinal soup...

00:17:46.398 --> 00:17:47.956
...only to cause an explosion!

00:17:50.569 --> 00:17:54.335
Wait one moment.
The medicine will be ready soon.

00:17:58.277 --> 00:18:01.110
I'm sorry that I scared you. It's all right.

00:18:04.016 --> 00:18:07.543
What are you doing?
What would you do if she got hurt?

00:18:08.353 --> 00:18:10.321
You're... talking...!

00:18:12.491 --> 00:18:14.652
If I remember correctly...

00:18:14.726 --> 00:18:16.990
...those were the first words you
said after coming to live with us.

00:18:17.362 --> 00:18:19.830
That's because there was a true
risk of you burning yourself.

00:18:20.566 --> 00:18:23.194
But after I'd drink
mother's medicinal soup...

00:18:23.769 --> 00:18:26.294
...I would become as well as an
ordinary child for a while.

00:18:27.239 --> 00:18:30.231
She taught me how to play the
erhu... We went persimmon picking...

00:18:30.876 --> 00:18:33.310
She strictly instructed
me all about manners.

00:18:33.378 --> 00:18:35.778
And we even made bean
paste buns together.

00:18:35.848 --> 00:18:38.408
We did so much together in a short
period of time, wasting not a moment...

00:18:39.218 --> 00:18:41.778
...until the next time I developed a fever.

00:18:43.655 --> 00:18:47.352
But it wasn't me that time had
run out on. It was mother.

00:18:50.462 --> 00:18:54.228
The reason I haven't pursued
things like romance or love...

00:18:54.833 --> 00:18:56.801
...may be because of mother.

00:18:57.769 --> 00:19:01.569
I may have been afraid to let my guard
down and fall in love with someone.

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:03.608
I have no confidence in myself.

00:19:04.209 --> 00:19:06.677
Maybe that's why I haven't
made any effort to find...

00:19:06.745 --> 00:19:09.213
...a person who's especially
important to me.

00:19:09.581 --> 00:19:13.312
And although I've always looked away,
that man was extremely aggressive.

00:19:14.586 --> 00:19:17.054
He's quite strange, but
since he has a pretty face...

00:19:17.356 --> 00:19:19.756
...when I noticed, my
heart would be pounding.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.694
That's a rather objective
analysis of yourself.

00:19:23.896 --> 00:19:25.693
Why are you laughing?

00:19:25.764 --> 00:19:28.426
Seiran, you probably don't understand
because you're handsome.

00:19:28.901 --> 00:19:32.496
But to the ordinary person, good
or bad looks are a major issue.

00:19:33.305 --> 00:19:35.273
That's a nice thing for you to say.

00:19:36.275 --> 00:19:40.473
That troublesome young master was
very good at exposing that weak point.

00:19:41.346 --> 00:19:45.407
No, maybe I'm just weak
against such pressure.

00:19:45.918 --> 00:19:48.819
Sorry, my answer's not
making much sense, is it?

00:19:49.655 --> 00:19:54.251
No, it's all right. Thanks so
much for thinking about me.

00:19:54.993 --> 00:19:56.961
R-Really?

00:19:59.431 --> 00:20:02.594
Oh, no. I'm suddenly really sleepy.

00:20:04.703 --> 00:20:08.469
I'll wake you up in the morning.
Please get a little sleep.

00:20:09.208 --> 00:20:11.176
But what about you, Seiran?

00:20:11.476 --> 00:20:13.944
I have more stamina,
so don't worry about me.

00:20:14.713 --> 00:20:17.876
Then sorry, but I'm
gonna sleep for a bit.

00:20:18.817 --> 00:20:20.284
Okay.

00:20:20.352 --> 00:20:24.812
I... I must take back the flower
bud, but...!

00:20:25.991 --> 00:20:27.253
What?

00:20:27.326 --> 00:20:32.628
That... belongs to me. So I'll do
everything I can on my own. Seiran.

00:20:34.132 --> 00:20:38.728
You mustn't spoil me... too much.

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:45.877
Hey!

00:20:46.511 --> 00:20:48.479
Oh, so you noticed me here?

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:52.380
I was curious, since you kept worrying.

00:20:52.884 --> 00:20:55.978
All you had to do is talk with her,
and your problem would be solved.

00:20:56.622 --> 00:20:59.591
Like they say,
"It's always darkest before the dawn".

00:21:02.261 --> 00:21:04.729
It's been a while since I've
had Princess' bean paste buns.

00:21:04.997 --> 00:21:09.491
I doubt she realizes how much
you're depending on her.

00:21:12.571 --> 00:21:16.769
A guy like you needs at
least three adults close by...

00:21:17.576 --> 00:21:20.044
...to make sure you don't
forget how to breathe.

00:21:20.379 --> 00:21:23.576
Princess, Mr. Shoka,
and I make three.

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:27.719
I'll trade the last one for any
grasshopper lying around.

00:21:27.786 --> 00:21:29.481
I have no use for you.

00:21:30.055 --> 00:21:33.616
What would you do in the winter, then?
I'm the one who works all year round!

00:21:34.192 --> 00:21:36.956
I'm having a hard time figuring
out how you like to be spoiled.

00:21:38.463 --> 00:21:41.660
By the way, it seems Senior Secretary of
Civil Affairs isn't taking action this time.

00:21:42.301 --> 00:21:44.269
He truly cherishes Princess.

00:21:45.103 --> 00:21:46.866
In which case, Sakujun...!

00:21:47.439 --> 00:21:49.839
Seeing that the head of the
Hong Clan is not making a move...

00:21:49.908 --> 00:21:53.036
...he won't see a point in pursuing
the title of the head of the Sa Clan.

00:21:53.745 --> 00:21:56.145
So I guess Sojun was
killed for nothing.

00:21:57.049 --> 00:21:59.483
At least Sojun was properly buried by
his younger brother's own two hands.

00:22:00.385 --> 00:22:04.719
Koku says he's gonna act today. But
his opponents are Chusho and Saku.

00:22:05.791 --> 00:22:07.918
He's acting on his own well
aware of that, right?

00:22:07.993 --> 00:22:10.018
I see surprising potential in that guy.

00:22:10.662 --> 00:22:13.460
Well... That may be true.

00:22:14.966 --> 00:22:17.594
I'm taking a nap so wake
me up when it's time.

00:22:17.669 --> 00:22:19.637
Huh?! What about me?!

00:22:19.871 --> 00:22:21.566
You've got more than
enough stamina...

00:22:21.640 --> 00:22:24.541
...but have only been doing deskwork
lately. So you can stay awake.

00:22:24.743 --> 00:22:28.304
Hey. That's not my fault.

00:22:32.250 --> 00:22:34.241
So, elder brother. I shall be off.

00:22:35.253 --> 00:22:37.118
You're going, are you?

00:22:37.823 --> 00:22:39.791
So you've decided.

00:22:41.793 --> 00:22:43.590
Can I ask you a favor?

00:22:44.529 --> 00:22:45.154
What's that?

00:22:45.797 --> 00:22:47.424
Please take care of Shunki.

00:22:47.499 --> 00:22:51.196
I know I can ask Mr. Ensei and would
have nothing to worry about, but...!

00:22:53.205 --> 00:22:55.230
I understand. I promise you.

00:22:56.341 --> 00:22:58.002
In case I die...

00:22:58.377 --> 00:22:59.309
I won't listen to the rest of that line.

00:23:00.879 --> 00:23:03.211
I also won't accept any message
for Miss Shunki.

00:23:03.281 --> 00:23:06.148
Do not speak of death so casually.

00:23:08.487 --> 00:23:10.955
You've given me nothing
but encouragement.

00:23:11.790 --> 00:23:14.224
I'll do my best.
And I won't die that easily!

00:23:15.894 --> 00:23:18.920
I'll go there and stop
Grandfather and Brother Sakujun!

00:23:30.509 --> 00:23:35.606
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.814 --> 00:23:42.151
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.454 --> 00:23:47.414
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.626 --> 00:23:52.723
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.732 --> 00:23:58.135
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.671 --> 00:24:04.802
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.577 --> 00:24:16.146
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.022 --> 00:24:22.619
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.028 --> 00:24:28.091
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:28.967 --> 00:24:34.530
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.906 --> 00:24:41.709
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.050 --> 00:24:45.417
Next Episode

00:24:45.417 --> 00:24:47.686
Next Episode
The time has finally
come to depart for Koren...

00:24:47.686 --> 00:24:47.719
Next Episode
1000 Years' Worth of
Thoughts in a Single Day

00:24:47.719 --> 00:24:48.253
Next Episode
1000 Years' Worth of
Thoughts in a Single Day

00:24:48.253 --> 00:24:50.655
Next Episode
1000 Years' Worth of
Thoughts in a Single Day
