as Governors of Sa Province...

00:24:50.655 --> 00:24:52.757
Next Episode
1000 Years' Worth of
Thoughts in a Single Day
...and to settle all the
problems facing us.

00:24:52.757 --> 00:24:53.158
Next Episode
1000 Years' Worth of
Thoughts in a Single Day

00:24:53.158 --> 00:24:54.359
Next Episode
1000 Years' Worth of
Thoughts in a Single Day
Now, is everyone ready?

00:24:54.359 --> 00:24:55.121
Now, is everyone ready?

00:24:55.327 --> 00:24:57.124
Then let's go!
